# GreenWells LPG Platform
# 
# This is a monorepo with:
# - Django backend in ./backend/
# - Next.js frontend in ./main-frontend/
#
# To work on the Next.js app, go to ./main-frontend/
# To work on the Django app, go to ./backend/
#
# Use npm run dev from root to start both servers

# This file is intentionally blank as dependencies are in subdirectories
# Next.js version is defined in main-frontend/package.json
# Django version is defined in backend/requirements.txt

